DATA SOURCES (bound through the @Observable model; web hook names kept at call sites)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  useIngestXRay -> IngestXRayDataSource.loadXRay(vehicleID:window:bucket:limit:)
                   (GET /system/ingest-xray/{numericId}?window=&bucket=&limit=100)  [model.reloadXRay]
  useVehicles   -> IngestXRayVehicleSource.loadVehicles()  (GET /vehicles)          [model.loadVehicles]
  The query-disabled phase (web `enabled: numericId > 0`) is the model's `.idle` xray state;
  selection/window/bucket changes re-key via `reloadToken` (web query-key re-key).

