(Charts=0 / maps=0 in the manifest record, so requiredCount=12 = 4 panels + 3 states +
 5 strings. The web page nonetheless ships a bar chart (XRayBucketChart); it was ported
 in full as GlassPanel3 with the native P3 TSBarChart wrapper — MORE parity, never less,
 covenant #2/#5. Beyond the 5 required strings, 44 more web keys were added — controls.*,
 vehicles.*, windowOption.*, windowLabel.*, bucketOption.*, stats.*, chart.*, fields.* —
 so every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names; zero
 hardcoded user-facing strings. An `error` state + Retry is also implemented for both
 sources (ADR spec "never a blank region"), though not among the 3 required states.)

